{'symbol': 'ALB', 'date': '2019-10-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'ALBEMARLE CORPORATION DECLARES DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 2, 2020', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ALBEMARLE CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.3675 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND, WHICH HAS AN ANNUALIZED RATE OF $1.47, IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 2, 2020, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS AS OF DECEMBER 13, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'ALB', 'date': '2019-10-28 04:30:00', 'title': 'MINERAL RESOURCES UPDATES ON FIRB APPROVAL FOR WODGINA TRANSACTION', 'text': 'ALBEMARLE CORPORATION NOTIFIED THAT FIRB HAS NO OBJECTION TO ITS ACQUISITION OF A 60% INTEREST IN WODGINA LITHIUM PROJECT.MINERAL RESOURCES LTD UPDATES ON FIRB APPROVAL FOR WODGINA TRANSACTION.'}